WEBVTT

00:01:57.204 --> 00:02:02.371
I'm the queen of vulnerability and I'm the
assistant queen of, like, boundaries.

00:02:02.371 --> 00:02:05.704
So we'll see. Let's go. Let's go as deep
as we can go and then we'll see.

00:02:05.996 --> 00:02:07.079
So I guess I guess the place

00:02:07.079 --> 00:02:11.121
I want to start today is to say that
you have convinced millions

00:02:11.121 --> 00:02:14.954
and millions of people that vulnerability
is not a sign of weakness.

00:02:14.954 --> 00:02:17.496
It can actually be a source of
strength and of connection.

00:02:18.329 --> 00:02:23.371
And yet so many people struggle to be
vulnerable at work and they decide to put

00:02:23.371 --> 00:02:26.371
on armor instead. And I wonder,
just for starters,

00:02:26.371 --> 00:02:29.996
if you could talk a little bit about why
people feel special pressure to put

00:02:29.996 --> 00:02:32.704
armor on at work and what kinds
of armor they wear.